[HELP]

  Keyboard controls 

  MOUSE wheel  :  Zoom			
  MOUSE left   :  Camera Movement	
  Space        :  Open doors
  Enter        :  Enter vehicle	
  Pag Up       :  Next Skin
  Pag Dn       :  Previous Skin

  w            :  Wiper
  (F,G)        :  Roll
  (+,-)        :  Exposure
  NUMPAD 7     :  Front Lights
  NUMPAD 8     :  Brake Lights
  NUMPAD(0,3)  :  Wings Animations